{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドレミファドンで\nぐるカー流れたあああ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/15/5805033/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/15/5805033/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたやありがたや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前の前の記事の\n脚落ちた件について"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右脚に所々あざができてしまった(;_;)\nしかもすねに直径約4センチのあざが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すねとか痛いやつ(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際、痛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど全然大きな怪我はしてないんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あざはすぐ消えるしね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配させてしまってすみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家にひきこもってます。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、\n凍結した道路とか滑って怪我したら\n怖いじゃん？\n身は自分で守るべきだしさっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...はーい、言い訳乙。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日こそ\n外に出よう！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンレター募集してる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nしてる！\nけどコメントの方が早く読めるから\nコメに書いてくださった方がありがたい＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪降った時はカマクラ派？\n雪だるま派？家でゴロゴロ派？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n家でゴロゴロ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日無事家に着いた？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nちょっと時間かかっちゃったけど\n電車で帰れたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何色の振り袖が着たい？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nママのを着るって決めてるから\nうちが選んだわけじゃないんだけど\n黒いやつだよ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々にやります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮っちゃうお"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/15/5805033/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/15/5805033/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NON STYLEの井上さんのポーズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あってるかなー(´・ω・`)\nこんな感じだったよね？(゜゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表情もナルシスト風に←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また今度いつか\n撮っちゃうお募集するねえー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだこないだ募集した時の\nリクエスト全然こたえきれてないから\n先になるけど＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んじゃ、\nまたあした〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/15/5805033/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}